    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Compass is a multi-chapter psychological horror game centered around exploration.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will experience interconnected yet standalone journeys, delving into fear, choice, and obsession on the threshold between life and death.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714090/extras/6455e7d79f583d5274e83ccb2305bc1c.avif?t=1748978934\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once-open path constricts around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not like a\u00a0winding subterranean labyrinth \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is only a narrow, irreversible passage hewn into stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your oxygen diminishes, so does your resolve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as despair threatens to overwhelm,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Hope</span></i> emerges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714090/extras/594050926a2190a6ccfaa5a89bd5c18e.avif?t=1748978934\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice scatter across the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are isolated and desperate, attempting to contact with a voice that may no longer exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven deeper into madness, you obediently pursue a conversation that may never have truly begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When casting dice becomes obsession, can you still be certain who\u2014or what\u2014you are speaking with?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714090/extras/4e6e959136e1e9c2e75ee3059cd781cb.avif?t=1748978934\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the compass needle forward. Some doors will open for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Segmented Adventures:</strong> Short, intense psychological horror episodes, distinct yet secretly interconnected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Experimental Narrative:</strong> A unique blend of gameplay mechanics and storytelling designed to deliver an unsettling psychological horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Retro Aesthetic:</strong> Nostalgic visuals inspired by VHS, Dither, and pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tAnd\u2026 Perhaps something remains unsaid?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Compass is a multi-chapter psychological horror game centered around exploration.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will experience interconnected yet standalone journeys, delving into fear, choice, and obsession on the threshold between life and death.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714090/extras/6455e7d79f583d5274e83ccb2305bc1c.avif?t=1748978934\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once-open path constricts around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not like a\u00a0winding subterranean labyrinth \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is only a narrow, irreversible passage hewn into stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your oxygen diminishes, so does your resolve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as despair threatens to overwhelm,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Hope</span></i> emerges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714090/extras/594050926a2190a6ccfaa5a89bd5c18e.avif?t=1748978934\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice scatter across the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are isolated and desperate, attempting to contact with a voice that may no longer exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven deeper into madness, you obediently pursue a conversation that may never have truly begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When casting dice becomes obsession, can you still be certain who\u2014or what\u2014you are speaking with?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714090/extras/4e6e959136e1e9c2e75ee3059cd781cb.avif?t=1748978934\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the compass needle forward. Some doors will open for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Segmented Adventures:</strong> Short, intense psychological horror episodes, distinct yet secretly interconnected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Experimental Narrative:</strong> A unique blend of gameplay mechanics and storytelling designed to deliver an unsettling psychological horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Retro Aesthetic:</strong> Nostalgic visuals inspired by VHS, Dither, and pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tAnd\u2026 Perhaps something remains unsaid?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
